### Change user role (requires admin authentication)
PUT http://localhost:4000/api/admin/users/1/role
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJkaXIiLCJlbmMiOiJBMjU2R0NNIn0..bRYtPhzo7BYSw3_z.fX71tzU989snbO2zB0V5fw31pA9-gyD2BzrS4k66VK1-we2Y0GZTy5pnM_yRusruybtDyCiclgXthvaNWhy2hFb7S4JfrUXbcyYms4D1dUgBwtMGoHtEQnlwZvtxWhdS377yKIKrMGRryqghT7BkUo3WC5BzvuMZBwoQFiArnbJC8Qk.aHc2ngX9fY3ntRUAJjgx_Q
